{title: Aziyat}
{artist: Pratyush Dhiman Jahnavi Rao}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A] Haule Haule se [E] aankhe rone [D] lagi [E],        [A] Nind na ayi [E] par aankhe sone [D] lagi [E]
[F#m] Sath nibhaye jo tu,        [E] janmo hi janmo ka to ye
[D] Yaari reh jaayegi (Reh [E] Jaayeinn),        [F#m] Takta rahu teri [E] nigaho ko darbadar ke
[D] Kuch toh keh jaayegi (keh [E] jaayegi),        Dur tu [A] hai ya hum ho [E] gaye
Faasle [D] the ya ab ho [E] gaye,        Jaane [A] kyun yeh rishtey jo [E] the
Khatam [D] ho gaye,        Kya teri meri [A] baatein ab main [E] karun
Kyun [D] aankhein bewajah hi [E] bharun,        Jaane kyun [A] yeh rishtey jo [E] the
Khatam ho [D] gaye,        [D] Toh kya hua tu [A] mera nahi [E]
Kahun na koi [D] baat main,        Firta rahun [A] awaara
[E] Saari ki saari [D] raat main,        [F#m] Sath nibhaye jo tu
[E] janmo hi janmo ka to ye,        [D] Yaari reh jaayegi [E]
[F#m] Takta rahu teri [E] nigaho ko darbadar ke,        [D] Kuch toh keh jaayegi Reh [E] Jaayeinn
Dur tu [A] hai ya hum ho [E] gaye,        Faasle [D] the ya ab ho [E] gaye
Jaane [A] kyun yeh rishtey jo [E] the,        Khatam [D] ho gaye
Kya teri meri [A] baatein ab main [E] karun,        Kyun [D] aankhein bewajah hi [E] bharun
Jaane kyun [A] yeh rishtey jo [E] the,        Khatam ho [D] gaye
